ce0ceddef8f1ef5f8415a3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/345d6f5a/uploads/origins/71815722-9391-4507-a766-a023732f3395?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34a222a68be58903791c60cafb16a914 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/345d6f5a/uploads/origins/71815722-9391-4507-a766-a023732f3395?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=419e276e5f34a2dc2a894391d7309595", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/345d6f5a/uploads/origins/71815722-9391-4507-a766-a023732f3395?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=419e276e5f34a2dc2a894391d7309595, https://si.imgix.net/345d6f5a/uploads/origins/71815722-9391-4507-a766-a023732f3395?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b24ac25eb38bb9f7948e6a8dc240e9e0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/345d6f5a/uploads/origins/71815722-9391-4507-a766-a023732f3395?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5420f3fa01723e2a66e7f056f3202267 3x"}, "body": "I am making a short film about a vtuber who goes on an odyssey to get rent money, and I thought your art style would be perfect for the poster that I wanted to post around social media! I may also use it for the title card in the film, if that would be alright with you! I'm making the film for me and my friends as a fun experiment, so I have no strict timeline for this request!\n\nThe basic idea for the poster is the protagonist's vtuber model opening her wallet with coins flying out while floating on a white background with the film's title under her in stylized letters (\"I Want Everyone to Like Me\"). \n\nHere is the Imgur album with reference images for the request: https://imgur.com/a/Q3QlIO2\n\nI have included a stick art sketch I drew up for the poster composition in the Imgur album (1st image). \n\nI have also included an annotated copy that draws attention so specific details I would like in the poster (2nd image). \n\nA full body image of the vtuber model, which I have the rights to, is also included (3rd image, if you need more images please let me know). \n\nI included an image of a figurine with the pose I would like in the poster (4th image).\n\nThe initial idea for this poster was inspired by the theatrical poster for the 1966 film The Crazy-Quilt, which I have included as a reference which may help illuminate the vibe I am going for (5th image). \n\n\nPlease let me know if you would be interested in this request! I love tuning into your art streams on Youtube and would be ecstatic if you would be able to complete this!", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@HirusakiTique/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2305142, "client_id": 3860360, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6ecbae34/uploads/origins/6542c72f-60e3-4ee8-8c7e-309448c56c23?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b0a78157b77d943384d9f6721fd34a32", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6ecbae34/uploads/origins/6542c72f-60e3-4ee8-8c7e-309448c56c23?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b0a78157b77d943384d9f6721fd34a32, https://si.imgix.net/6ecbae34/uploads/origins/6542c72f-60e3-4ee8-8c7e-309448c56c23?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f1221393b98a3308ae5e583b161c323b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6ecbae34/uploads/origins/6542c72f-60e3-4ee8-8c7e-309448c56c23?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bf5427feed3a87261cd9c1ca89f8184b 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6ecbae34/uploads/origins/6542c72f-60e3-4ee8-8c7e-309448c56c2